			<_description type="p"><IDescription type="e">
				<_textRTF type="a">{\rtf1\fbidis\ansi\ansicpg1255\deff0\deflang1037{\fonttbl{\f0\fnil\fcharset0 MS Sans Serif;}{\f1\fnil\fcharset177 MS Sans Serif;}}%0D
\viewkind4\uc1\pard\ltrpar\f0\fs17 The keypad has ten keys numbered 0 through 9.\par%0D
A code is any four digits.\par%0D
By default the code is 1234\par%0D
\par%0D
If at any time a mistake is made, the Off key can be pressed to restart entering the code.\par%0D
\par%0D
\f1\rtlch\par%0D
}%0D
</_textRTF>
			</IDescription>
